#N canvas 20 20 700 300 12;
#X text 20 20 t_kit -- c_kit's stand-in in a gate's scratch copy: it prints each pad and velocity it is sent as KITOUT: <pad> <velocity> \, which is how sequencer-assert reads the drums c_steps plays. c_kit takes no creation arguments and has one inlet \, as this does., f 80;
#X obj 20 120 inlet;
#X obj 20 160 route pad;
#X obj 20 200 print KITOUT;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
